// T8: Tools that disappeared
// Tools used in the last 30 days but not in the last 2 days. A tool that stops being called after a change usually means a broken connector or a changed agent.
AgentToolCalls(30d)
| summarize FirstSeen = min(timestamp), LastSeen = max(timestamp), Calls = count() by Agent, Tool
| where LastSeen < ago(2d)
| order by LastSeen desc
